[statement]
The same repository as `dependency-order-decides-a-shared-virtual-y-first`, with
`b` listing `x` before `y`. Now `x` is decided first, by priority, for `p1`,
and `y` still needs `p2`: both are installed.

[repository]
P:b
V:1.0-r0
D:x y

P:p1
V:1.0-r0
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1.0-r0
p:x y=1
k:10

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1.0-r0
install p2 1.0-r0
install b 1.0-r0
